- The active submission is exactly seven columns: team_id, site_id, bus_id, connection_capacity_mw, generator_capacity_mw, storage_power_mw, and storage_energy_mwh.
- It has one row per site, not hourly period/load_mw rows; capacities use MW/MWh.
- bus_id values come from the selected scenario block.
- The path-only CSV checker is student-facing; --artifact-dir can check bus_id values against a released catalog. The instructor-side evaluator and output are authoritative.

